    "https://studentsuccess.mst.edu/careerdevelopmentcouncil/": {
      "title": "Career Development Council",
      "description": "Career Development Council –\r\n    Student Success |\n    \r\n    Missouri S&T Skip to content Back to S&T Home Apply Visit Inquire Give Campus Map Departments Find a Department View A to Z directory Search Clear No results found. View all departments For You For You Future Students S&T Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Family & Friends Tools & Resources Canvas Email Joe'SS My S&T MinerLink myHR Directory News Social Media Events Library Search Explore S&T Missouri S&T Student Success Student Resources Family & Faculty Resources Departments & Programs Meet the Team About Us Campus relocations studentsuccess.mst.edu Career Development Council Career Development Council Student Success Career Development Council Student Resources News Family & Faculty Resources Meet the Team Departments & Programs Career Development Council About Us Left Right Student Resources News Family & Faculty Resources Meet the Team Departments & Programs Career Development Council About Us Left Right Left Right Main Content Building Bridges at Missouri S&T The Career Development Council (CDC) at Missouri S&T is a group of industry professionals who engage with students and provide feedback to develop career-ready graduates. CDC members also sponsor events like the Student Leadership Conference and facilitate connections between their companies and the university. Annual sponsorship donation Employer resources CDC Mission Engaging alumni and employers to prepare S&T students for career success. Membership Benefits Increase your company's visibility and reputation on campus. Engage directly with students. Provide valuable feedback on program initiatives aimed at preparing career-ready graduates. Positively influence student's personal and professional development Receive exclusive updates and information about engagement opportunities through the year. Initiatives Each year, the funds generated are used to support initiatives that are open to any student and support the CDC mission. Questions? If you are interested in learning more about CDC, please contact Sara Hathaway, at 573-341-4254 . Missouri S&T Student Success Missouri University of Science and Technology 102 Parker Hall, 300 W. 13th St 573-341-4292 success@mst.edu Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri S&T, Rolla, MO 65409 800-522-0938 webmaster@mst.edu Work at S&T Accreditation University Police Our Brand S&T Alerts Giving Student Accessibility and Testing Parking Facebook Twitter Youtube All S&T Accounts Missouri S&T is an equal opportunity employer . © The Curators of the University of Missouri UM System Privacy Policy Consumer Information Terminalfour 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Accessibility Support Missouri S&T - Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri University of Science and Technology Close Search Search only Yes No Top Searches How to Apply Post Admission Checklist Costs & Fees Academic Dates Scholarships Advising Quick Links Directory Campus Map Current Students Parking S&T Email Giving to S&T Missouri S&T - Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri University of Science and Technology Apply Visit Inquire Give Close Academics Menu Academics Overview of Academics Search Degrees & Programs Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Graduate Certificates Online Degrees & Certificates Pre-College Summer Programs Admissions Menu Admissions & Aid Overview of Admissions & Aid First-Time Freshman Transfer Students International Students Graduate Students Online & Distance Military Students Dual Enrollment Summer Camp Students Campus Life Menu Campus Life Overview of Campus Life Living Options Miner Athletics Student Organizations Recreation Design Teams The Rolla Community Research Menu Research Overview of Research Office of Research & Innovation Faculty Experts Research Core Research News Innovation & Entrepreneurship University Libraries For You Future Students S&T Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Family & Friends Quick Links Social Events News Campus Map Directory The S&T Store About S&T Overview Rankings Leadership Giving S&T Alerts Work at S&T Facebook Instagram Linked In Twitter Youtube Discord TikTok All S&T Accounts Learn how Missouri S&T is Solving For Tomorrow Missouri S&T 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Policies Privacy"
