    "https://career.mst.edu/resources/students/handshake/": {
      "title": "Handshake",
      "description": "Handshake –\r\n    Career Opportunities and Employer Relations |\n    \r\n    Missouri S&T Skip to content Back to S&T Home Apply Visit Inquire Give Campus Map Departments Find a Department View A to Z directory Search Clear No results found. View all departments For You For You Future Students S&T Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Family & Friends Tools & Resources Canvas Email Joe'SS My S&T MinerLink myHR Directory News Social Media Events Library Search Explore S&T Missouri S&T Career Opportunities and Employer Relations Schedule an Appointment Career Fair Resources For Students For Alumni For Employers For Faculty and Staff Programs Co-ops Internships About What We Do Staff Directory Statistics and Figures Policies and Procedures career.mst.edu Resources Students Handshake Handshake Career Closet Handshake Co-Ops Internships Left Right Career Closet Handshake Co-Ops Internships Left Right Left Right Main Content You Asked, & We Listened…Handshake is Back as S&T’s Career Hub! Handshake is your gateway to real opportunities , connecting you directly with employers, co-ops & internships, & job opportunities. Claim your handshake account: Handshake The more you engage with Handshake, the more opportunities it surfaces, making it easier to take meaningful steps toward your future. Claim your profile to get started in Handshake Complete your profile so employers can find you & match you with relevant opportunities Search & apply for internships, co-ops, part-time jobs, & full-time roles tailored to your interests Register for events like career fairs, employer events, info sessions, and workshops Connect with employers and follow companies you’re interested in Get personalized recommendations based on your major, skills, and career goals Make an appointment with a career advisor to get one - on - one career assistance Missouri S&T Career Opportunities and Employer Relations Missouri University of Science and Technology 900 Innovation Dr, Rolla, MO 65401 573-341-4343 career@mst.edu Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri S&T, Rolla, MO 65409 800-522-0938 webmaster@mst.edu Work at S&T Accreditation University Police Our Brand S&T Alerts Giving Student Accessibility and Testing Parking Facebook Instagram All S&T Accounts Missouri S&T is an equal opportunity employer . © The Curators of the University of Missouri UM System Privacy Policy Consumer Information Terminalfour 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Accessibility Support Missouri S&T - Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri University of Science and Technology Close Search Search only Yes No Top Searches How to Apply Post Admission Checklist Costs & Fees Academic Dates Scholarships Advising Quick Links Directory Campus Map Current Students Parking S&T Email Giving to S&T Missouri S&T - Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri University of Science and Technology Apply Visit Inquire Give Close Academics Menu Academics Overview of Academics Search Degrees & Programs Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Graduate Certificates Online Degrees & Certificates Pre-College Summer Programs Admissions Menu Admissions & Aid Overview of Admissions & Aid First-Time Freshman Transfer Students International Students Graduate Students Online & Distance Military Students Dual Enrollment Summer Camp Students Campus Life Menu Campus Life Overview of Campus Life Living Options Miner Athletics Student Organizations Recreation Design Teams The Rolla Community Research Menu Research Overview of Research Office of Research & Innovation Faculty Experts Research Core Research News Innovation & Entrepreneurship University Libraries For You Future Students S&T Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Family & Friends Quick Links Social Events News Campus Map Directory The S&T Store About S&T Overview Rankings Leadership Giving S&T Alerts Work at S&T Facebook Instagram Linked In Twitter Youtube Discord TikTok All S&T Accounts Learn how Miss